WEBVTT

00:01:31.000 --> 00:01:34.930
After she became in charge of the baby beast-lord Lilan, Erin realized

00:01:34.930 --> 00:01:40.850
that the sound of the harp was similar to that of a wild beast-lord's voice.

00:01:41.520 --> 00:01:48.610
She thought that if she could refine the sounds, then Lilan would respond more to them.

00:01:50.620 --> 00:01:52.550
Oh no!  Oh no!

00:01:53.170 --> 00:01:55.150
What's the problem?

00:01:55.150 --> 00:01:57.370
Erin's missing!

00:01:57.370 --> 00:02:00.760
If it's Erin, she went to town with Tomura-senpai.

00:02:03.720 --> 00:02:04.770
Don't tell me...

00:02:05.130 --> 00:02:06.110
What's wrong?

00:02:06.110 --> 00:02:08.680
Yeah, it has to be.

00:02:09.070 --> 00:02:10.560
So what is it?

00:02:11.340 --> 00:02:13.810
They've eloped!

00:02:14.260 --> 00:02:17.830
You gave them permission?!

00:02:18.400 --> 00:02:20.620
Yes, I did.

00:02:20.620 --> 00:02:21.780
If the rules are not followed-

00:02:21.780 --> 00:02:22.160
I decided to place my bets on Erin.
If the rules are not followed-

00:02:22.160 --> 00:02:25.210
I decided to place my bets on Erin.

00:02:28.350 --> 00:02:32.170
I've been to a harp shop in the capital before.

00:02:32.860 --> 00:02:40.220
If we go there and have them tune my harp, I might be able to make the sound.

00:02:44.670 --> 00:02:48.070
Wait for me, Lilan.

00:02:51.600 --> 00:02:57.590
The Sound of the Harp

00:02:58.370 --> 00:03:00.610
Can you tell who made this?

00:03:01.400 --> 00:03:05.830
I can tell that it wasn't made by us non-Wajyaku.

00:03:09.340 --> 00:03:11.090
Egg thieves...

00:03:11.090 --> 00:03:14.210
and Saigamul who are after the Queen...

00:03:19.620 --> 00:03:21.400
Here you are.  Thanks.

00:03:23.450 --> 00:03:25.720
A vagabond from the Grand Duke's quarter!

00:03:25.720 --> 00:03:28.020
Who does he think he is, living here?

00:03:28.690 --> 00:03:29.730
Get him!

00:03:29.730 --> 00:03:32.880
Please stop, Officials!

00:03:33.480 --> 00:03:35.730
Look!  Here's the proof!

00:03:36.700 --> 00:03:39.700
You're the one who's distributing this flier, aren't you?

00:03:39.700 --> 00:03:44.290
This thing was around all over the place even before I opened the store!

00:03:44.290 --> 00:03:46.520
We'll listen to you at the office.

00:03:46.520 --> 00:03:48.100
You damn Wajyaku!

00:03:48.100 --> 00:03:49.480
Take him away!

00:03:49.480 --> 00:03:50.120
It's not me!

00:03:50.120 --> 00:03:54.710
That damn Holon...  Don't think you can be so high and mighty for long.

00:03:58.360 --> 00:04:03.220
"Beast-lords have fallen from the sky, and so has Her Majesty."

00:04:06.130 --> 00:04:09.260
<i>Don't you see how wrong this world is?</i>

00:04:11.350 --> 00:04:14.310
<i>Those living in the Queen's quarter, who do not go to war,</i>

00:04:14.980 --> 00:04:19.630
<i>disdain those from the Grand Duke's quarter, who shed their blood in those wars, slandering them with the name of Wajyaku.</i>

00:04:19.630 --> 00:04:23.280
<i>Those from the Grand Duke's quarter disdain those living in Queen's quarter, vilifying them with the name of Holon.</i>

00:04:24.320 --> 00:04:26.960
<i>They're both the citizens of the same country.</i>

00:04:27.730 --> 00:04:31.210
<i>This wrongness is the mother which bore the Saigamul.</i>

00:04:37.200 --> 00:04:39.380
This country's true face, huh?

00:05:03.610 --> 00:05:04.320
What?

00:05:08.120 --> 00:05:09.030
Who are you?!

00:05:45.030 --> 00:05:46.610
<i>How old are you guys now?!</i>

00:05:47.470 --> 00:05:50.080
<i>You can't beat me even with the two of you?!</i>

00:06:05.730 --> 00:06:06.880
Get out of my way!

00:06:13.650 --> 00:06:14.560
You're pretty good.

00:06:42.180 --> 00:06:43.100
Excuse me.

00:06:44.830 --> 00:06:47.080
Hey, you're...

00:06:47.080 --> 00:06:49.470
Thank you for your help back then.

00:06:50.300 --> 00:06:51.890
Are you here to fix your harp again?

00:06:52.600 --> 00:06:59.770
No.  This time, I want you to tune this so it makes the sound I want.

00:07:01.580 --> 00:07:07.360
Dang, I'm going out now to drop off some products, and won't be back til tomorrow.

00:07:07.360 --> 00:07:09.250
We're in a hurry.  Could you please?

00:07:09.250 --> 00:07:13.220
I'm sorry.  They're my key customers, so I can't say no to them.

00:07:13.800 --> 00:07:15.240
I see.

00:07:15.660 --> 00:07:18.850
We beg you!  Please help the little girl!

00:07:18.850 --> 00:07:20.120
Please!

00:07:31.800 --> 00:07:35.360
I'll be back tomorrow, so use the place as you like until then.

00:07:35.360 --> 00:07:36.920
Thank you very much!

00:07:37.340 --> 00:07:39.680
Look after my place now.

00:07:40.060 --> 00:07:40.770
I will.

00:07:52.320 --> 00:07:53.700
What are you going to do, Erin?

00:08:10.970 --> 00:08:16.890
If I use a blanket and the harp, I know I can make that sound.

00:08:17.360 --> 00:08:19.400
I'll tune the harp first.

00:08:29.900 --> 00:08:31.200
Who is...

00:08:45.250 --> 00:08:47.950
It's a good song no matter when I hear it.

00:08:47.950 --> 00:08:49.790
I'm gonna play it, too.

00:08:53.220 --> 00:08:56.260
You guys!  If you're going to get in the way, I'll kick you out!

00:08:59.200 --> 00:08:59.930
What was that?

00:09:02.320 --> 00:09:03.970
Hey, come help us!

00:09:03.970 --> 00:09:05.420
We have a problem!

00:09:05.420 --> 00:09:07.400
What is it, seriously?

00:09:11.490 --> 00:09:13.010
He's badly wounded!

00:09:28.580 --> 00:09:29.880
This person is...

00:09:43.890 --> 00:09:46.200
Dessert is served.

00:09:47.860 --> 00:09:50.430
Where is Seimiya-sama?

00:09:51.390 --> 00:09:54.520
She's locked herself up in her room since that day.

00:09:54.520 --> 00:09:57.300
Since what happened on your birthday?

00:09:57.300 --> 00:09:58.260
Yes.

00:09:59.160 --> 00:10:03.000
No one can blame her, after seeing such a thing.

00:10:03.520 --> 00:10:07.000
Let's get some beautiful flowers from Kazalm sent to her.

00:10:07.510 --> 00:10:12.210
They will be flowers from a peaceful land, so it will be sure to relax her heart.

00:10:12.860 --> 00:10:14.970
Thank you, Sir Kazalm.

00:10:15.530 --> 00:10:18.430
That would be great, if you might.

00:10:18.980 --> 00:10:20.660
I most gladly will.

00:10:21.220 --> 00:10:24.200
If you would excuse me now, Your Majesty.

00:10:24.200 --> 00:10:27.190
Oh, is something waiting for you?

00:10:27.740 --> 00:10:31.940
Yes.  I must water the withering flower.

00:10:43.960 --> 00:10:45.290
How frightening.

00:10:45.880 --> 00:10:47.280
Seimiya-sama.

00:10:48.210 --> 00:10:49.120
Yes?

00:10:52.320 --> 00:10:54.590
A gift is here for you.

00:10:55.760 --> 00:10:57.060
From who?

00:10:57.060 --> 00:10:57.590
It's these.

00:10:58.690 --> 00:11:01.980
Oh my, such beautiful flowers.

00:11:08.740 --> 00:11:10.450
It's from Shunan.

00:11:11.620 --> 00:11:12.800
Oh my.

00:11:12.800 --> 00:11:13.860
What's the matter?

00:11:17.210 --> 00:11:21.080
He writes, "I am always by your side."

00:11:21.840 --> 00:11:24.970
What a reassuring gift.

00:11:27.880 --> 00:11:30.740
Shunan...  Good job getting in my way.

00:11:44.570 --> 00:11:47.280
How can I make that sound?

00:11:59.550 --> 00:12:00.940
<i>Are you hesitating?</i>

00:12:01.410 --> 00:12:05.680
<i>If you don't stop me now, I may point my blade at the Queen.</i>

00:12:06.660 --> 00:12:08.300
<i>Why are you doing this?</i>

00:12:11.230 --> 00:12:15.980
<i>Ial, you know why the Sezans were formed, right?</i>

00:12:17.170 --> 00:12:24.440
<i>In the past, the Saigamul had said that the Queen had been the cause of that which divides this country and forbids its growth,</i>

00:12:24.440 --> 00:12:26.270
<i>and so they set the palace on fire.</i>

00:12:30.560 --> 00:12:35.110
<i>In that fire, Harumiya-sama's mother, Miimiya-sama died.</i>

00:12:35.760 --> 00:12:40.850
<i>Only Her Highness Harumiya-sama, three-years-old at the time, and her grandmother, Shiimiya-sama, survived.</i>

00:12:45.890 --> 00:12:53.090
<i>The Grand Duke at the time, who had been accused of setting the fire, found the true criminal and proved himself innocent,</i>

00:12:54.510 --> 00:12:58.870
<i>and swore to kill all the Saigamul.</i>

00:13:01.040 --> 00:13:04.800
<i>However killing all of the Saigamul was no easy task.</i>

00:13:06.170 --> 00:13:09.950
<i>You've taught me that's why the Sezans were formed.</i>

00:13:10.550 --> 00:13:16.060
<i>Then as the last thing I teach you, let me tell you what I've learned from seeing the world from its underside:</i>

00:13:20.150 --> 00:13:22.040
<i>At this rate, this country will...</i>

00:13:23.630 --> 00:13:24.600
<i>end!</i>

00:13:28.310 --> 00:13:30.370
<i>You can't beat me even with the two of you?!</i>

00:13:52.810 --> 00:13:57.750
<i>I will not believe in those who try to change the world through killing.</i>

00:13:58.420 --> 00:14:02.400
<i>Even if it's you, my benefactor.</i>

00:14:04.540 --> 00:14:06.240
<i>That's the right choice.</i>

00:14:07.080 --> 00:14:12.570
<i>It's the heart which believes in itself that's necessary to accomplish something.</i>

00:14:14.030 --> 00:14:15.500
<i>Still, are you ready?</i>

00:14:43.550 --> 00:14:44.530
Where am I?

00:14:47.380 --> 00:14:48.570
Great.

00:14:49.010 --> 00:14:52.030
You've come to, Ial-san.

00:14:53.770 --> 00:14:55.290
How do you know my name?

00:15:00.440 --> 00:15:01.880
That's right.

00:15:07.370 --> 00:15:09.270
Your wound will open again!

00:15:11.070 --> 00:15:13.320
You know this guy?

00:15:13.320 --> 00:15:13.960
Yes.

00:15:14.740 --> 00:15:16.990
Are you a doctor?

00:15:17.730 --> 00:15:20.420
I'm studying at school to become a beastinarian.

00:15:56.660 --> 00:15:57.940
That harp.

00:15:58.350 --> 00:15:59.850
What are you trying to do to it?

00:16:08.940 --> 00:16:18.190
There's a sound I want to make, even if it forever kills the lovely sound it makes now.

00:16:19.040 --> 00:16:20.380
A sound you want to make?

00:16:21.170 --> 00:16:23.860
The sound of a wild beast-lord's voice.

00:16:23.860 --> 00:16:25.940
H-Hey, if you say any more than that-

00:16:25.940 --> 00:16:28.130
I won't mention it to anyone.

00:16:29.990 --> 00:16:31.300
I promise.

00:16:39.270 --> 00:16:43.610
I want to save a certain beast-lord, no matter what.

00:16:45.090 --> 00:16:52.700
A very poor baby beast-lord that's been separated from its mother and injured by an arrow.

00:16:59.370 --> 00:17:03.000
If it weren't for that baby, I would be dead.

00:17:03.490 --> 00:17:05.300
You mean that wound is...

00:17:07.120 --> 00:17:11.380
You used your body as a shield, didn't you?

00:17:11.380 --> 00:17:12.910
"Shield?"

00:17:13.590 --> 00:17:15.550
A-A Sezan?!

00:17:15.550 --> 00:17:18.290
E-Excuse me!  Sorry for my rudeness!

00:17:18.730 --> 00:17:24.850
Ial-san.  Please teach me how to fashion a harp.

00:17:37.210 --> 00:17:38.910
Don't hesitate.

00:17:41.190 --> 00:17:44.260
The path you choose is not always correct.

00:17:44.850 --> 00:17:49.620
But to save a life, there are times when you mustn't hesitate.

00:17:50.220 --> 00:17:53.550
That's all the same for Sezans and doctors.

00:17:57.430 --> 00:17:58.350
Give it a try.

00:19:49.120 --> 00:19:50.810
She hasn't changed.

00:19:53.310 --> 00:19:56.840
She had those same eyes when I met her four years ago, too.

00:20:26.180 --> 00:20:28.720
If this doesn't work...

00:20:32.730 --> 00:20:33.920
<i>Don't hesitate.</i>

00:20:45.100 --> 00:20:47.520
Esal-sensei!  Esal-sensei!

00:20:47.520 --> 00:20:48.650
Come in.

00:20:50.250 --> 00:20:51.940
What's the rush?

00:20:51.940 --> 00:20:55.080
Lilan!  It's Lilan!

00:20:55.080 --> 00:20:57.340
All right!  Stay away!

00:20:57.340 --> 00:20:59.190
Don't come inside here!

00:20:59.760 --> 00:21:01.080
Is that Tomura-senpai?

00:21:01.930 --> 00:21:04.060
Esal-sensei is with him, too.

00:21:59.890 --> 00:22:02.920
Lilan's...  Lilan's...

00:22:09.510 --> 00:22:17.350
Erin was able to feed Lilan using her harp.

00:22:18.620 --> 00:22:26.710
This became the first step Erin and Lilan took toward their future.

00:24:01.970 --> 00:24:04.650
Erin might get kicked out of Kazalm?!

00:24:04.650 --> 00:24:06.590
What did Erin ever do?!

00:24:06.590 --> 00:24:08.550
Because she doesn't use the mute whistle?

00:24:08.550 --> 00:24:10.110
Or because she's of the Mist People?

00:24:10.110 --> 00:24:12.520
It's because she's not obeying the Beast-Lord Imperatives.

00:24:12.520 --> 00:24:14.960
She was the only one who succeeded in
feeding the beast-lord,

00:24:14.960 --> 00:24:17.180
so why is she getting kicked out?

00:24:17.180 --> 00:24:18.900
We've got to do something!

00:24:18.900 --> 00:24:20.910
But, how?

00:24:21.340 --> 00:24:25.090
Kemono no Souja Erin.  Kazalm's Oath.

00:24:25.090 --> 00:24:30.070
Kazalm's Oath
